 "guidance": {
  "status": "ok",
  "transcriptsRead": 3,
  "statements": [
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 15,
    "speaker": "Rakesh Sharma",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "But when we unbundle this 9%, we find that the upper half, particularly the upper half of the upper half, is maintaining very strong growth, which just indicates that still the people with stronger wallets are coming in and we have had a very, very good start to the mini season, which is led by marriages in the northern parts of the country.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-05-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-05",
    "callLabel": "May 2026 call · Q4 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-05",
    "page": 22,
    "speaker": "Chandramouli Muthiah",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "And the second question is just around the prepared remarks that Rakesh had made that you'd hope to grow faster than the 7% to 9% broader motorcycle industry growth outlook.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-02-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-02",
    "callLabel": "Feb 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-02",
    "page": 4,
    "speaker": "Rakesh Sharma",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We expect this growth momentum in the industry to continue and the motorcycle industry to continue to grow at, say, 12% to 15%.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2026-02-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2026-02",
    "callLabel": "Feb 2026 call · Q3 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2026-02",
    "page": 10,
    "speaker": "Kapil Singh",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "You had last time mentioned 6% to 8% industry growth outlook in the medium term.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-1",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 4,
    "speaker": "Rakesh Sharma",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "Though November and particularly December will be smaller months, we think that the industry should improve its growth rate by 6 to 8 percentage points in the medium term and offer us very good opportunities to attract customers to our Pulsar portfolio, which is being further strengthened by the introduction of the new variants in the next 2-3 months.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   },
   {
    "id": "call-2025-11-2",
    "sourceId": "call-2025-11",
    "callLabel": "Nov 2025 call · Q2 FY26",
    "callMonth": "2025-11",
    "page": 5,
    "speaker": "Rakesh Sharma",
    "voice": "management",
    "quote": "We expect the same pattern to continue with the GST rate cut, lifting the ICE Auto growth by about 5% points.",
    "structuredBy": "none"
   }
  ],
